# Overrides xr-driver-git's /usr/lib/udev/rules.d/70-uinput-xr.rules, which
# lets the logged-in user write /dev/uinput. With this file in place uinput stays
# root:root 0600, as the three-finger drag service requires. sway-xr sends head
# tracking over OpenTrack UDP and does not use uinput. Delete this file only to
# use the driver's mouse or joystick output modes.
